#: ../src/ui/dialog/filter-effects-dialog.cpp:2810
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Uniformly blurs its input. Commonly used together with Offset to create a "
"drop shadow effect."
msgstr ""
" <b>feGaussianBlur</b> फिल्टर प्रिमिटिव्ह ताजे इनपुट समान धुसर करता. ड्रॉपसावळी "
